/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (The Department of AI & ML, with the Design Club, organized a MERN Stack series to provide students with hands-on experience in MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js. The first event, "Getting Started with React," was held on May 29, 2024, led by                  Ms. Saritha Suvarna, Assistant Professor, Department of CSE, CEC. She introduced React fundamentals and guided attendees in creating React applications. The second event, "Building APIs with Express.js and Node.js," on June 5, 2024, was conducted by                 Mr. Adithya Pai B., who taught API creation and server setup. The final event, "Integrating MongoDB and Node.js," on June 12, 2024, also by Adithya Pai B., covered MongoDB integration and CRUD operations. The event was coordinated by  Mr. Deepak D.)
/E (The Department of AI & ML, with the Design Club, organized a MERN Stack series to provide students with hands-on experience in MongoDB, Express.js, React, and Node.js. The first event, "Getting Started with React," was held on May 29, 2024, led by                  Ms. Saritha Suvarna, Assistant Professor, Department of CSE, CEC. She introduced React fundamentals and guided attendees in creating React applications. The second event, "Building APIs with Express.js and Node.js," on June 5, 2024, was conducted by                 Mr. Adithya Pai B., who taught API creation and server setup. The final event, "Integrating MongoDB and Node.js," on June 12, 2024, also by Adithya Pai B., covered MongoDB integration and CRUD operations. The event was coordinated by  Mr. Deepak D.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [21]
